name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-postassessment-q1_2025'

right 'Option A, because it responds immediately to the user\'s input and reduces extra steps.'
wrong 'Option B, because it gives the app more time to load data before showing results.'
wrong 'Option A, because it makes the website\'s design more colorful and animated.'
wrong 'Option B, because fewer buttons usually mean better design.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 1
MARKDOWN

markdown <<MARKDOWN
A travel website wants users to easily compare flight prices. The designer is deciding between these two options:

- **Option A:** Prices update automatically when the user changes travel dates.
- **Option B:** Users must press "Check Prices" every time they change a date.

Which option better supports user-centered interactivity, and why?
MARKDOWN
